# Cloudflare Pages - Routing
# NOTE: no catch-all rewrite here! A rule like "/* /index.html 200" would
# swallow /api/* requests BEFORE the Pages Function runs, killing the API.
#
# SPA fallback is handled inside functions/[[path]].ts (non-/api HTML
# requests that miss a static file get index.html). Client-side routing is
# hash-based, so deep links always load "/" anyway.
